OL,3,AHenry Zeffman: Andy Burnham and his
OL,4,Achancellor have a battle on their hands
OL,5,Aas the Budget approaches
OL,6,
OL,7,FMuch of the tricky economic
OL,8,Fenvironment, yes, is driven by global
OL,9,Ffactors including the persistence, and
OL,10,Fto some degree worsening, of the
OL,11,Fconflicts in the Middle East and
OL,12,FUkraine.
OL,14,FAnd the AI boom pushing up borrowing
OL,15,Fcosts is another issue affecting many
OL,16,Fcountries.
